      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The methodology will employ a dual-guide RNA (dgRNA) strategy to achieve precise allelic modification within the target exon of the *CFTR* locus. Delivery of the Cas9 endonuclease complex will be facilitated via optimized lipid nanoparticle (LNP) encapsulation for targeted transduction of murine lung epithelial cell populations. Subsequent assessment of editing efficiency will necessitate high-throughput next-generation sequencing (NGS) analysis, while comprehensive whole-genome sequencing will be performed to rigorously quantify and characterize any potential off-target genomic perturbations.",
      "source": "target",
